0) Create the mechanism starting from a yaml file in mech folder

    python3 0-prepareMechanism.py

        - the construction is based on the chemkin II files, so that we don't have to rely on cantera to build pyjacob.
        - some versions of cantera are not fully compatible with pyjacob, therefore it's better to avoid to use that.

        INSIDE the python, other than creating the chemkin format of the mechanism, it does the following:

        *** Create the pyjacob construction

        python3 -m pyjac -l c -i mech/chem.inp -t mech/therm.dat -ls <inertSpecies>

        - <inertSpecies> is the last inert species used in the yaml file, as well as in OpenFOAM.

        python3 -m pyjac.pywrap -so out -l c

1) Create the CSP VTK planes

    python3 1-createVTKs.py
    
2) Create the CSP plot

    python3 2-contour-CSP.py
    
    
    
########### IF ONE WANTS TO EVALUATE CSP OVER AN AXIAL LINE

3) create Axial line 

    python3 3-createAxialLine.py
    
    
4) plot the multiPlot

    python3 4-reactionAnalysis.py
    
    
    
    
########### TO CLEAN

    python3 Allclean.py

